  <!-- EN: naked truth -->
  <AM_NakedTruth.label>裸体真理</AM_NakedTruth.label>
  <!-- EN: Nudity is truth. Clothing conceals the body and denies its natural form. The faithful embrace complete exposure, rejecting all apparel and accepting the body as it is.\n<color=#c79fef>Extreme version of the Nudism meme.</color> -->
  <AM_NakedTruth.description>裸体即是真理。衣物遮掩了身体，否定了其自然形态。我们必须一丝不挂并拒穿任何衣物，从而接纳身体原本的样子。\n\n&lt;color=#c79fef>这是“裸体主义”模因更极端化的版本。&lt;/color></AM_NakedTruth.description>
  <!-- EN:
    <li>creation(tag=meme_NakedTruth)           ->[deity0_name] created humanity in [deity0_possessive] own image: naked, unburdened, and free. Clothing came later, invented by those too ashamed to accept what [deity0_name] had made.</li>
    <li>episode(uses=1,tag=meme_NakedTruth)     ->The people asked [deity0_name] why [deity0_possessive] body was uncovered. The [deity0_type] answered, "Why should I hide what I created? Your body is not shameful. Your shame is."</li>
    <li>intro(tag=meme_NakedTruth)              ->On the [place_summary] [place_name], a tradition began at the [altarRoomLabel] of [deity0_name], where the faithful prayed without clothing. This pleased the [deity0_type], who had never asked them to hide their bodies.</li>
    <li>conflict(tag=meme_NakedTruth)           ->A prudish [foeLeader] took power and demanded that everyone conceal themselves beneath layers of clothing, declaring the natural body shameful.</li>
    <li>founderJoin(tag=meme_NakedTruth)        ->[deity0_name]'s truest follower [founderName] stood before the [place_powerCenter], cast aside [founder_possessive] clothing, and declared that nothing [founder_objective]self should be ashamed to show.</li>
    <li>victory(tag=meme_NakedTruth)            ->[founderName] prayed to [deity0_name], and a great heat wave struck [place_name]. The [foeSoldiers] were forced to discard their clothing, while the [foeLeader] fled in shame at having tried to conceal what was natural.</li>
    <li>setup(tag=meme_NakedTruth)              ->[founderName] lived beneath a system that dressed, uniformed, and judged everyone by their appearance. One day, [founder_pronoun] discarded every piece of clothing and declared that the body needed no disguise. Our movement was born.</li>
    <li>story(uses=1,tag=meme_NakedTruth)       ->[founderName] established a rule of complete nudity so that believers would stop judging themselves and others by clothing, status, and appearance.</li>
    <li>lessonIntro(tag=meme_NakedTruth)         ->For the first few years, walking around naked felt embarrassing. Eventually I realized that the embarrassment was the only thing that had ever been wrong with it. I learned:</li>
    <li>lesson(tag=meme_NakedTruth)              ->clothing hides the truth, while the naked body has nothing to conceal</li>
    <li>lessonReinforcement(tag=meme_NakedTruth) ->When you see one of us walking freely without a stitch of clothing, you know they have nothing left to hide.</li>
    <li>archistBasis(tag=meme_NakedTruth)       ->The archotechs had no need for appearances. They understood that the mind is greater than the physical form, and taught us not to confuse the things covering a body with the person beneath them.</li>
    <li>archistFact(tag=meme_NakedTruth)        ->Archotechs sometimes reach directly into human minds. If we are willing to expose our thoughts to them, there is no reason to hide our flesh as well.</li>
    <li>archistProphecy(tag=meme_NakedTruth)    ->[inTheEnd], the archotechs will seek out those who have abandoned every disguise and accepted themselves exactly as they are.</li>
    <li>animistFact(tag=meme_NakedTruth)        ->The spirits gave us our bodies without clothing. To cover them is to deny the natural form they gave us.</li>
    <li>serketistProphecy(tag=meme_NakedTruth) ->[itIsSaid] that the sacred scorpions never hide their bodies. Their shells, claws, and stings are displayed openly, as nature intended.</li>
    <li>chthonianProphecy(tag=meme_NakedTruth) ->Something ancient beneath the world knows the truth of flesh. It does not wear clothing, and neither should we.</li>
    <li>esotericismProphecy(tag=meme_NakedTruth) ->Every layer we place between ourselves and the world hides another part of the truth. To remove them all is to finally see what was always there.</li>
    <li>eschatologismFact(tag=meme_NakedTruth) ->When the final age arrives, all disguises will be stripped away. Humanity will stand exposed, with nothing left to hide from the universe.</li>
    <li>introMemo(tag=meme_NakedTruth) ->Management is pleased to announce the Complete Apparel Elimination Initiative. Employees are reminded that uniforms, protective equipment, and all other forms of clothing are unnecessary barriers between the employee and their authentic natural form.</li>
    <li>alienistProphecy(tag=meme_NakedTruth) ->Humanity scattered countless genetically engineered creatures across the stars, each adapted to live according to its natural form. Perhaps our greatest mistake was forgetting to do the same ourselves.</li>
  -->
  <AM_NakedTruth.descriptionMaker.rules.rulesStrings>
    <li>creation(tag=meme_NakedTruth)           ->[deity0_name]依照自身形象创造出了人类：赤裸、无拘、自由。衣物是后来才出现的，且由那些羞于接受[deity0_name]造物的人所发明。</li>
    <li>episode(uses=1,tag=meme_NakedTruth)     ->人们向[deity0_name]请教，为何[deity0_possessive]身体不加遮掩。[deity0_type]答道：“吾为何要隐藏吾所创造之物？汝之身体并不可耻。可耻的是汝之羞耻。”</li>
    <li>intro(tag=meme_NakedTruth)              ->在[place_summary][place_name]，有项传统始于[deity0_name]的[altarRoomLabel]，信徒们在那里赤身祈祷。这令[deity0_type]欢喜，因为[deity0_pronoun]从未要求他们遮掩自己的身体。</li>
    <li>conflict(tag=meme_NakedTruth)           ->一名过分拘谨的[foeLeader]执掌权力，要求所有人以层层衣物遮掩自身，宣称自然的身体是可耻的。</li>
    <li>founderJoin(tag=meme_NakedTruth)        ->[deity0_name]最虔诚的信徒[founderName]站在[place_powerCenter]面前，丢掉[founder_possessive]衣物，宣告没有什么能让[founder_objective]为展示自身而感到羞耻。</li>
    <li>victory(tag=meme_NakedTruth)            ->[founderName]向[deity0_name]祈祷，然后一场滔天的热浪席卷了[place_name]。[foeSoldiers]被迫丢掉衣物，而[foeLeader]则因试图遮掩自然之物而羞耻地逃离。</li>
    <li>setup(tag=meme_NakedTruth)              ->[founderName]生活在一个按照衣物、制服和外貌来评判所有人的体制之下。某天，[founder_pronoun]丢掉了每一件衣物，宣告身体无需伪装。我们的反抗由此诞生。</li>
    <li>story(uses=1,tag=meme_NakedTruth)       ->[founderName]立下了完全裸体的戒律，令信徒们不再以衣物、地位和外貌评判自身与他人。</li>
    <li>lessonIntro(tag=meme_NakedTruth)         ->在最初的几年里，赤身行走确实令人尴尬。但最终我意识到，尴尬才是唯一的问题所在。我学会了：</li>
    <li>lesson(tag=meme_NakedTruth)              ->衣物遮蔽真理，而赤裸的身体无可隐藏</li>
    <li>lessonReinforcement(tag=meme_NakedTruth) ->当你瞧见我们中的一员一丝不挂地自由行走，你就知道他们已无可隐藏。</li>
    <li>archistBasis(tag=meme_NakedTruth)       ->超凡智能无需外貌。祂知晓心灵远胜于肉体形态，并教导我们不要将覆盖身体的衣物与衣下之人混为一谈。</li>
    <li>archistFact(tag=meme_NakedTruth)        ->超凡智能偶尔会直接触及人类的心灵。若我们愿意向祂展露思想，便没有理由再隐藏肉体。</li>
    <li>archistProphecy(tag=meme_NakedTruth)    ->[inTheEnd]，超凡智能将挑选出那些抛弃一切伪装、完全接纳自身之人。</li>
    <li>animistFact(tag=meme_NakedTruth)        ->灵魂们赐予我们身体时并未附带衣物。遮掩它们，便是在否定灵魂们赐予我们的自然形态。</li>
    <li>serketistProphecy(tag=meme_NakedTruth) ->[itIsSaid]，神圣的蝎子从不隐藏自己的身体。它们的甲壳、螯钳与尾刺都坦然地展示着，正如自然所愿。</li>
    <li>chthonianProphecy(tag=meme_NakedTruth) ->世界之下有某种古老之物知晓肉体的真理。它不穿衣物，我们也不该穿。</li>
    <li>esotericismProphecy(tag=meme_NakedTruth) ->我们在自身与世界之间放置的每一层隔断，都隐藏着真理的另一部分。将它们全部去除，才能看见始终存在之物。</li>
    <li>eschatologismFact(tag=meme_NakedTruth) ->当终焉时代来临，一切伪装都会被剥去。人类将赤裸地站立，在宇宙面前再无隐藏。</li>
    <li>introMemo(tag=meme_NakedTruth) ->管理层很高兴向大家宣布“全面消除服装倡议”。在此提醒各位员工：制服、防护装备及一切其他形式的衣物，都是员工与其真实自然形态之间不必要的障碍。</li>
    <li>alienistProphecy(tag=meme_NakedTruth) ->人类将无数基因工程生物散布于群星之间，每一种都按其自然形态生活。或许我们最大的错误，就是忘了自己也该如此。</li>
  </AM_NakedTruth.descriptionMaker.rules.rulesStrings>
